WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.251
Agents pick their own paths.

2
00:00:02.267 --> 00:00:06.678
Same input on Monday, a different tool call on Tuesday.

3
00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:13.391
Provider updates can change tool selection. A small rewording of the system prompt can change tool selection.

4
00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:17.411
You cannot enumerate every execution path in advance.

5
00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:23.851
The fix is to capture the actual production trace, and make the trace itself the audit artifact.
